OL,3,GNEWSARoad closure postponed due to wind
OL,4,Awarnings
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlanned evening closures of the main
OL,7,Froad to the south of the Isle of Man
OL,8,Fhave been partly postponed because of a
OL,9,Fweather warning for gale-force winds.
OL,11,FRichmond Hill had been due to shut on
OL,12,FMonday and Tuesday evenings for
OL,13,Fdrainage work, but the Department of
OL,14,FInfrastructure (DOI) said the road
OL,15,Fwould now stay open on both nights.
OL,17,FThe department said keeping the route
OL,18,Fopen meant it would be available if
OL,19,Fother roads became blocked, and allow
OL,20,Fstaff to respond to any problems caused
OL,21,Fby the weather.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB IOM NewsC Reg TVF Clean Feed
