OL,3,GNEWSARoad closure postponed due to wind
OL,4,Awarnings
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe road will still close between 18:30
OL,7,Fand 22:30 on Wednesday and Thursday,
OL,8,Fwith the remaining work moved to Monday
OL,9,F2 and Tuesday 3 November at the same
OL,10,Ftime.
